845	 The 2.0 line ships as a **pre-release**: it soaks with real users, fixes land as `-rc.N`, and `2.0.0` is promoted once the exit criteria in the [rc.1 release notes](grimoires/loa/reports/release-notes-2.0.0-rc.1.md) are met. Stable users can stay on `v1.202.1` until then.
